let __v_3675 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"cake\"]},\"Order a decorated one four to six weeks ahead: the bakery wants the number of people and the design about a month out, and the week itself it can turn round. A fruit cake is the exception: it is baked well before and fed brandy as it sits, and it only gets better.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"turkey\",\"goose\",\"bird\"]},\"Order it by the middle of December, and collect it on the 22nd or 23rd so it has two days in the fridge. Free-range and big birds go first, so the middle of the month is the real deadline.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"invitation\",\"invite\",\"save\"]},\"Six to eight weeks before the day, with the reply-by four weeks out - eight to twelve if people have to travel or fly. The venue and any rooms are the things that go a year ahead, not the cards.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"passport\"]},\"Ten weeks is the honest allowance for a standard renewal, and quicker costs extra. Check the country you are going to as well: many want six months left on it at the date you arrive, not the date you leave.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"parking\"]},\"Two to four weeks ahead is plenty and the price is the reason: the on-the-day rate at an airport is several times the booked one, and the cheap car parks go first. The date and the flight time are all they need.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"hotel\",\"accommodation\",\"cottage\",\"campsite\",\"room\"]},\"As soon as the dates are fixed. A hotel needs nothing from you but a card, and the cheap rooms are the ones that sell out first - a refundable rate booked early beats a dearer one late.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"table\",\"restaurant\"]},\"Two to four weeks ahead for a Friday or Saturday, and a week or two for a weeknight. Somewhere small or famous you book when you think of it, and a set menu also wants the numbers a few days before.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"flight\",\"ferry\",\"train\",\"ticket\",\"travel\"]},\"Six to twelve weeks ahead is the cheapest window: a flight is dearest in the last fortnight and a train is best booked the day the tickets release, about twelve weeks out. After that the price only climbs.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"venue\",\"hall\",\"church\",\"marquee\"]},\"A year or more for a Saturday in summer, and two years for the popular ones. The venue sets the date, so it is the first thing booked and everything else fits round it.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"flower\",\"delivery\",\"bouquet\",\"gift\",\"present\"]},\"Three to five days ahead for a delivery on a set day, and a fortnight for anything made to order or for Valentine's and Mother's Day. Same-day is a different, dearer price.\"]}]}")?;
